* patches/macos-product-dir-name.patch and patches/macos-keychain-name.patch
  follow the approach used by Helium (imputnet/helium-macos, GPL-3.0).
  No Helium code is included: both patches were generated independently against
  pristine Chromium source and substitute different values. The only expression
  authored by Helium in its equivalents -- its own replacement strings -- does
  not appear here.

